# Day 37 – Build Task Compass 🧭

## Challenge
Today I built **Task Compass**, an interactive organizational learning simulator using Claude AI.

The application teaches how work flows across teams by assigning ownership, routing tasks, improving collaboration, and making organizational decisions through real-world workplace scenarios.

---

## What I Learned

### 👤 Ownership
- Learned who should own different workplace tasks.
- Clear ownership improves accountability and execution.

### 🔄 Workflow Thinking
- Understood how tasks move across departments.
- Efficient routing reduces delays and confusion.

### 🤝 Collaboration
- Experienced how multiple teams work together to solve complex problems.
- Good communication is essential for successful execution.

### 🏢 Management Simulation
- Built an interactive workplace management simulator.
- Learned organizational thinking through practical scenarios.

